{"displayStem":"수술 후 크론병 재발 평가 방법을 비교하는 무작위 배정 모형이다. 양 군은 각 100명이고 2년 완전 추적이며 재발 정의와 검사 시점은 같다. 실제 치료효과 추정이 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 370\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 06의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"370\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"64\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">사건 위험 (%)</text><path d=\"M75 60L75 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M75 290L600 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M68 290.0L75 290.0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"297.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M68 236.25L75 236.25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"243.25\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><path d=\"M68 182.5L75 182.5\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"189.5\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text><path d=\"M68 128.75L75 128.75\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"135.75\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><path d=\"M68 75.0L75 75.0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"82.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"128.75\" width=\"90\" height=\"161.25\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"217.375\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><text x=\"195\" y=\"118.75\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">통상 평가</text><rect x=\"340\" y=\"193.25\" width=\"90\" height=\"96.75\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"385.0\" y=\"249.625\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><text x=\"385\" y=\"183.25\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><text x=\"385\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">집중 평가</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">각 100명 · 2년</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}